        "POSE-LOCKED A-POSE 2-STAGE CONCEPT WORKFLOW (Universal DWPose Stick Figure + Built-In #30343b Slate Lock \u2014 stock ComfyUI nodes only)\n- Node 1: Drop in the character's dialogue portrait or classic sprite reference.\n- Nodes 6 & 18: Edit the Subject description (one universal stick figure works across male, female, stocky, robed, dress, and heavy armor builds without distorting proportions).\n- Node 25: Pre-loaded with rusty-poselock-dwpose.png (canonical 22deg arm / 18deg elbow / 25deg curled palm-inward hands / parallel 3-pt feet). Optional depth maps rusty-poselock-xbot-depth.png / rusty-poselock-ybot-depth.png are also uploaded.\n- Stage 1 Union: strength=1.00, end=0.95 | Stage 2 Krea New B: denoise=0.38 (8 steps)."
