      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Painting style of Larry Elmore, Brom style, gothic fantasy illustration, dark_fantasy_illustration.\n\nDrawn and painted as a vivid, punchy 1990s PC fantasy role-playing game character sheet: confident dark-umber pen-and-ink contour lines, fine crosshatching only inside cloth folds and overhangs equally on both sides, and opaque matte gouache colour planes (4 to 6 painted value groups per material). Soft even overhead light equal on both sides. Plain flat solid dark slate-grey background, RGB 48,52,59, no floor, no cast shadow, no scenery, no border.\n\nSubject and pose: Full-length isolated character from head to feet. An athletic poised young female Dark Brotherhood temple dancer in her twenties with warm olive-tan skin, a completely shaved bald head with a single long glossy jet-black ponytail falling down behind her back, sharp high-arched dark eyebrows, pale blue-grey eyes and calm expression; wearing a fitted pale pearl-white silver satin halter crop bodice leaving her shoulders, arms and midriff bare, matching bright burnished-gold metal cuff bracelets on both wrists, and a low-slung dark charcoal-black waist belt with a long narrow tapering charcoal-black ceremonial front loincloth panel richly bordered in bright gold trim with gold embroidered scrollwork hanging straight down between her bare legs to her ankles, standing barefoot. Standing straight and symmetric facing directly forward, head level and looking straight ahead, shoulders level. Both arms hang down and slightly away from her sides at about 22 degrees with a clear gap of background between each hand and her hips, elbows softly bent slightly forward, wrists straight, palms facing inward toward her thighs, thumbs pointing forward, fingers together and gently curled in a relaxed hanging hand (nothing held, empty hands, not spread open). Legs straight, feet flat and parallel pointing straight ahead about hip-width apart with a clear gap between the legs from mid-thigh down."
      ]
    },
